Installation steps
Download the current .NET 10 ASP.NET Core Runtime – Hosting Bundle from Microsoft.
Run the installer as Administrator.
Complete the installation.
Restart IIS services or reboot the PSM server.

After installation, run:

Stop-Service WAS -Force
Start-Service W3SVC

Then recycle the Health Check application pool:

Import-Module WebAdministration

Restart-WebAppPool -Name "HealthCheckAppPool"
Confirm the correct runtime

Run:

& "$env:ProgramFiles\dotnet\dotnet.exe" --list-runtimes

You should now see both:

Microsoft.AspNetCore.App 10.0.x
Microsoft.NETCore.App 10.0.x

Your application pool has Enable32BitApplications : False, and the event log identifies the application architecture as x64. Therefore, the important installation is the x64 .NET 10 Hosting Bundle.
